      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for the draft. I ran it through the system and it actually got a Prestige Score of 93, which is a really solid start for the brand.\n\nThe tone is definitely there, but I'm a bit worried about the actual details. I feel like some of the specific info about the unit is getting buried under all those descriptors. For example, the buyer needs to clearly see the layout and the scale of the views without having to dig through a lot of flowery language.\n\nCan you try another version? Try to keep that high-end feel that the score showed, but see if you can make it even more impactful. And honestly, if you can get that Prestige Score even higher while still making the specs stand out, that would be perfect. Just... don't make it a word salad, okay? Keep it professional.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
